r is located at $(4,5).$\n\nIn the given equation, we also have ${a}^{2}=16$ and ${b}^{2}=3.$\n\n- Since ${a}^{2}=16,$ the length of the horizontal radius must be $a=\\sqrt{16}=4.$\n\n- Since ${b}^{2}=3,$ the length of the vertical radius must be $b=\\sqrt{3}.$\n\nSo the semi-major axis has length $a=4,$ and the semi-minor axis has length $b=\\sqrt{3}.$\n\nTherefore, the major axis has length $2a=2\\cdot 4=8,$ and the minor axis has length $2b=2\\cdot \\sqrt{3}=2\\sqrt{3}.$" 13194139533942 true] [17592186267520 1000 #edb/ref 17592186267521 13194139533942 true] [17592186267520 1000 #edb/ref 17592186267522 13194139533942 true] [17592186267520 1000 #edb/ref 17592186267523 13194139533942 true] [17592186267520 1000 #edb/ref 17592186267524 13194139533942 true] [17592186267520 1000 #edb/ref 17592186267525 13194139533942 true] [17592186267520 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533942 true] [17592186267520 1041 "selection" 13194139533942 true] [17592186267520 1104 #edb/ref 17592186267525 13194139533942 true] [17592186267520 1110 #uuid "2f761cbe-abb1-559e-9aa7-659ab750727f" 13194139533942 true] [17592186267521 1034 "$16$ and $3$" 13194139533942 true] [17592186267521 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533942 true] [17592186267521 1111 #uuid "adf73a4d-9982-5d4b-ac21-2c0249b86c04" 13194139533942 true] [17592186267522 1034 "$8$ and $1.5$" 13194139533942 true] [17592186267522 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533942 true] [17592186267522 1111 #uuid "6d28ada4-9e2a-50ac-9caa-04804b72e507" 13194139533942 true] [17592186267523 1034 "$4$ and $\\sqrt{3}$" 13194139533942 true] [17592186267523 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533942 true] [17592186267523 1111 #uuid "4e06cd29-e31f-5f19-b9c4-c1d3169194f2" 13194139533942 true] [17592186267524 1034 "$5$ and $4$" 13194139533942 true] [17592186267524 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533942 true] [17592186267524 1111 #uuid "05712535-f147-51fc-aa8d-1781c6b2ab21" 13194139533942 true] [17592186267525 1034 "$8$ and $2\\sqrt{3}$" 13194